      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.79 (up from ₹1.70 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹722.1m (up 53% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹21.8m (up 65% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.0% (up from 2.8% in 2Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 35% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
